{"created": "2024-11-22T14:59:04.103813+00:00", "modified": "2024-11-22T15:01:32.263611+00:00", "id": 14205018, "conceptrecid": "14205017", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14205018", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.14205017", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14205018", "metadata": {"title": "A Prefrontal Cortex Map based on Single Neuron Activity", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14205018", "publication_date": "2024-11-22", "description": "<p>Intermediate results files (after preprocessing) to recreate the figures from:</p>\n<p><em><strong>A Prefrontal Cortex Map based on Single Neuron Activity, </strong></em>Pierre Le Merre*, Katharina Heining*<em>,&nbsp;Marina&nbsp;Slashcheva, Felix&nbsp;Jung,&nbsp;Eleni&nbsp;Moysiadou, Nicolas&nbsp;Guyon,&nbsp;Ram&nbsp;Yahya, Hyunsoo&nbsp;Park, Fredrik&nbsp;Wernstal, and </em><em>Marie&nbsp;</em><em>Carl&eacute;n.</em> Equal contribution.</p>\n<p>Article currently available at: https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2024.11.06.622308v2</p>\n<p>The raw data can be found at: https://dandiarchive.org/dandiset/001260?pos=1</p>\n<p>Description: Brain-wide high-density extracellular recordings (Neuropixels) in head-fixed mice during distinct passive listening and auditory behavioral tasks. About half of the recordings are in the prefrontal cortex (PFC) and half from other brain regions (3 cortical and 10 subcortical). In PFC we include 11 subregions: secondary motor area (MOs), anterior cingulate area &ndash; dorsal and ventral part (ACAd, ACAv), prelimbic area (PL), infralimbic area (ILA), orbital area &ndash; medial, lateral, and ventrolateral part (ORBm, ORBvl, ORBl), agranular insular area &ndash; dorsal and ventral part (AId, AIv), and frontal pole (FRP).</p>\n<p>The code generating these intermediate files from the raw data can be found at: https://github.com/hejDMC/pfcmap</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Le Merre, Pierre", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "orcid": "0000-0003-4205-7411"}, {"name": "Heining, Katharina", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "orcid": "0000-0003-1976-3764"}, {"name": "Carl\u00e9n, Marie", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "orcid": "0000-0003-1658-1631"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Slashcheva, Marina", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0002-7918-8151"}, {"name": "Jung, Felix", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0002-7565-977X"}, {"name": "Moysiadou, Eleni", "affiliation": "Institut du Cerveau", "type": "DataCollector"}, {"name": "Guyon, Nicolas", "affiliation": "ESPCI Paris", "type": "DataCollector", "orcid": "0000-0003-1287-8606"}, {"name": "Yahya, Ram", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "type": null}, {"name": "Hyunsoo, Park", "affiliation": "AstraZeneca (Sweden)", "type": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-5754-9617"}, {"name": "Wernstal, Fredrik", "affiliation": "Karolinska Institutet", "type": null, "orcid": "0009-0002-4192-5897"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://doi.org/10.1101/2024.11.06.622308", "relation": "isPublishedIn", "resource_type": "publication", "scheme": "other"}, {"identifier": "https://dandiarchive.org/dandiset/001260", "relation": "isSourceOf", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "other"}], "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/hejDMC/pfcmap", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}, {"id": "julia", "title": {"en": "Julia"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "14205017"}}]}}, "title": "A Prefrontal Cortex Map based on Single Neuron Activity", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14205018", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14205018", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/142